"2026-04-06T20:42:00Z\"><w:r><w:rPr><w:color w:val=\"000000\"/></w:rPr><w:t xml:space=\"preserve\">University </w:t></w:r></w:ins><w:ins w:id=\"71\" w:author=\"Mixell, Daniel S.\" w:date=\"2026-04-06T15:43:00Z\" w16du:dateUtc=\"2026-04-06T20:43:00Z\"><w:r><w:rPr><w:color w:val=\"000000\"/></w:rPr><w:t xml:space=\"preserve\">may, at its discretion </w:t></w:r><w:r w:rsidR=\"000A6644\"><w:rPr><w:color w:val=\"000000\"/></w:rPr><w:t>and at its expense, file patent applications in the United States and in foreign countries for any University or Joint Invention</w:t></w:r></w:ins><w:ins w:id=\"72\" w:author=\"Mixell, Daniel S.\" w:date=\"2026-04-06T15:44:00Z\" w16du:dateUtc=\"2026-04-06T20:44:00Z\"><w:r w:rsidR=\"005D09E2\"><w:rPr><w:color w:val=\"000000\"/></w:rPr><w:t>s</w:t></w:r></w:ins><w:ins w:id=\"73\" w:author=\"Mixell, Daniel S.\" w:date=\"2026-04-06T15:43:00Z\" w16du:dateUtc=\"2026-04-06T20:43:00Z\"><w:r w:rsidR=\"000A6644\"><w:rPr><w:color w:val=\"000000\"/></w:rPr><w:t xml:space=\"preserve\">. University also will, at Colgate’s </w:t></w:r><w:r w:rsidR=\"005D09E2\"><w:rPr><w:color w:val=\"000000\"/></w:rPr><w:t>request and expense, file patent applications in the United States for U</w:t></w:r></w:ins><w:ins w:id=\"74\" w:author=\"Mixell, Daniel S.\" w:date=\"2026-04-06T15:44:00Z\" w16du:dateUtc=\"2026-04-06T20:44:00Z\"><w:r w:rsidR=\"005D09E2\"><w:rPr><w:color w:val=\"000000\"/></w:rPr><w:t xml:space=\"preserve\">niversity or Joint inventions. </w:t></w:r></w:ins><w:r w:rsidR=\"009015F9\" w:rsidRPr=\"00784C71\"><w:rPr><w:color w:val=\"000000\"/></w:rPr><w:t>Colgate</w:t></w:r><w:ins w:id=\"75\" w:author=\"Mixell, Daniel S.\" w:date=\"2026-04-06T15:44:00Z\" w16du:dateUtc=\"2026-04-06T20:44:00Z\"><w:r w:rsidR=\"00A069B2\"><w:rPr><w:color w:val=\"000000\"/></w:rPr><w:t xml:space=\"preserve\"> will make any such request to </w:t></w:r><w:proofErr w:type=\"gramStart\"/><w:r w:rsidR=\"00A069B2\"><w:rPr><w:color w:val=\"000000\"/></w:rPr><w:t>University</w:t></w:r><w:proofErr w:type=\"gramEnd\"/><w:r w:rsidR=\"00A069B2\"><w:rPr><w:color w:val=\"000000\"/></w:rPr><w:t xml:space=\"preserve\"> in writing and within 60 days of University’s notice of Invention disclosure. University will keep Colgate </w:t></w:r><w:r w:rsidR=\"00136C8A\"><w:rPr><w:color w:val=\"000000\"/></w:rPr><w:t>promptly i</w:t></w:r></w:ins><w:ins w:id=\"76\" w:author=\"Mixell, Daniel S.\" w:date=\"2026-04-06T15:45:00Z\" w16du:dateUtc=\"2026-04-06T20:45:00Z\"><w:r w:rsidR=\"00136C8A\"><w:rPr><w:color w:val=\"000000\"/></w:rPr><w:t>nformed regarding the status of any patent application filed at Colgate’s expense and will give Colgate reasonable opportunity to comment.</w:t></w:r></w:ins><w:del w:id=\"77\" w:author=\"Mixell, Daniel S.\" w:date=\"2026-04-06T15:45:00Z\" w16du:dateUtc=\"2026-04-06T20:45:00Z\"><w:r w:rsidR=\"009015F9\" w:rsidRPr=\"00784C71\" w:rsidDel=\"00136C8A\"><w:rPr><w:color w:val=\"000000\"/></w:rPr><w:delText xml:space=\"preserve\"> shall have the exclusive right to prepare and file applications for, prosecute, maintain, defend and assert, at its own costs, the Research Project IP.  University shall reasonably assist and cooperate with Colgate at Colgate’s expense in perfecting, maintaining and defending the rights granted to Colgate in this Section 5.3.1, including the provision of any requested documentation necessary for prosecution or maintenance of patents claiming such Research Project IP, and the execution of any required documents therefor.  Unless obligated by applicable Law, University shall not file any patent applications claiming, or amend any patent applications to claim, any Research Project IP. If despite the foregoing, University files any patent applications claiming, or amends any patent applications to claim, any Research Project IP, University agrees to assign such patent applications to Colgate.</w:delText></w:r></w:del><w:r w:rsidR=\"009015F9\" w:rsidRPr=\"00784C71\"><w:rPr><w:color w:val=\"000000\"/></w:rPr><w:t xml:space=\"preserve\">  </w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId=\"0B291BF7\" w14:textId=\"62BA38D0\" w:rsidR=\"002266B5\" w:rsidRPr=\"00DA6010\" w:rsidRDefault=\"009015F9\"><w:pPr><w:numPr><w:ilvl w:val=\"2\"/><w:numId w:val=\"2\"/></w:numPr><w:pBdr><w:top w:val=\"nil\"/><w:left w:val=\"nil\"/><w:bottom w:val=\"nil\"/><w:right w:val=\"nil\"/><w:between w:val=\"nil\"/></w:pBdr><w:spacing w:after=\"240\"/><w:jc w:val=\"both\"/><w:rPr><w:b/><w:color w:val=\"000000\"/></w:rPr></w:pPr><w:r w:rsidRPr=\"00DA6010\"><w:rPr><w:b/><w:i/><w:color w:val=\"000000\"/></w:rPr><w:t>License</w:t></w:r><w:del w:id=\"78\" w:author=\"Mixell, Daniel S.\" w:date=\"2026-04-06T15:47:00Z\" w16du:dateUtc=\"2026-04-06T20:47:00Z\"><w:r w:rsidRPr=\"00DA6010\" w:rsidDel=\"003440B8\"><w:rPr><w:b/><w:i/><w:color w:val=\"000000\"/></w:rPr><w:delText xml:space=\"preserve\"> to Universit</w:delText></w:r></w:del><w:del w:id=\"79\" w:author=\"Mixell, Daniel S.\" w:date=\"2026-04-06T15:46:00Z\" w16du:dateUtc=\"2026-04-06T20:46:00Z\"><w:r w:rsidRPr=\"00DA6010\" w:rsidDel=\"003440B8\"><w:rPr><w:b/><w:i/><w:color w:val=\"000000\"/></w:rPr><w:delText>y</w:delText></w:r></w:del><w:r w:rsidRPr=\"00DA6010\"><w:rPr><w:b/><w:i/><w:color w:val=\"000000\"/></w:rPr><w:t xml:space=\"preserve\"> for Internal</w:t></w:r><w:ins w:id=\"80\" w:author=\"Mixell, Daniel S.\" w:date=\"2026-04-06T15:47:00Z\" w16du:dateUtc=\"2026-04-06T20:47:00Z\"><w:r w:rsidR=\"003440B8\"><w:rPr><w:b/><w:i/><w:color w:val=\"000000\"/></w:rPr><w:t xml:space=\"preserve\"> Use</w:t></w:r></w:ins><w:del w:id=\"81\" w:author=\"Mixell, Daniel S.\" w:date=\"2026-04-06T15:47:00Z\" w16du:dateUtc=\"2026-04-06T20:47:00Z\"><w:r w:rsidRPr=\"00DA6010\" w:rsidDel=\"003440B8\"><w:rPr><w:b/><w:i/><w:color w:val=\"000000\"/></w:rPr><w:delText xml:space=\"preserve\"> Research Purposes</w:delText></w:r></w:del><w:r w:rsidRPr=\"00DA6010\"><w:rPr><w:b/><w:color w:val=\"000000\"/></w:rPr><w:t xml:space=\"preserve\">.  </w:t></w:r><w:del w:id=\"82\" w:author=\"Mixell, Daniel S.\" w:date=\"2026-04-06T15:50:00Z\" w16du:dateUtc=\"2026-04-06T20:50:00Z\"><w:r w:rsidRPr=\"00DA6010\" w:rsidDel=\"00EA6EF7\"><w:rPr><w:color w:val=\"000000\"/></w:rPr><w:delText>Colgate, on behalf of itself and its Affiliates, grants to University a perpetual, non-exclusive, non-sublicensable, non-assignable license to use the Deliverables and Research Project IP solely for internal research purposes</w:delText></w:r></w:del><w:ins w:id=\"83\" w:author=\"Mixell, Daniel S.\" w:date=\"2026-04-06T15:50:00Z\" w16du:dateUtc=\"2026-04-06T20:50:00Z\"><w:r w:rsidR=\"00EA6EF7\"><w:rPr><w:color w:val=\"000000\"/></w:rPr><w:t xml:space=\"preserve\"> </w:t></w:r><w:r w:rsidR=\"00EA6EF7\" w:rsidRPr=\"00EA6EF7\"><w:rPr><w:color w:val=\"000000\"/></w:rPr><w:t xml:space=\"preserve\">Each party (\"Licensor\") grants to the other party (\"Licensee\") a non-exclusive, royalty-free license to use, reproduce, prepare derivative works, display, distribute and perform all Licensor-owned </w:t></w:r><w:r w:rsidR=\"0059641D\"><w:rPr><w:color w:val=\"000000\"/></w:rPr><w:t xml:space=\"preserve\">outcomes and </w:t></w:r><w:r w:rsidR=\"00EA6EF7\" w:rsidRPr=\"00EA6EF7\"><w:rPr><w:color w:val=\"000000\"/></w:rPr><w:t>Copyrightable Works other than computer software and its documentation and informational databases for Licensee's internal research purposes, provided that Licensee shall not have the right to distribute copies or derivative works to third parties. For Licensor-owned Copyrightable Works that are identified as a deliverable under the Statement of Work and in the nature of computer software (and its documentation) or informational databases, Licensor grants to Licensee for Licensee's internal research purposes a royalty-free, non-transferable, non-exclusive license to use, reproduce, prepare derivative works, display and perform such Copyrightable Works.</w:t></w:r></w:ins><w:del w:id=\"84\" w:author=\"Mixell, Daniel S.\" w:date=\"2026-04-06T15:50:00Z\" w16du:dateUtc=\"2026-04-06T20:50:00Z\"><w:r w:rsidRPr=\"00DA6010\" w:rsidDel=\"00EA6EF7\"><w:rPr><w:color w:val=\"000000\"/></w:rPr><w:delText>.</w:delText></w:r></w:del></w:p><w:p w14:paraId=\"43228B60\" w14:textId=\"2CEBFC66\" w:rsidR=\"002266B5\" w:rsidRPr=\"00642419\" w:rsidRDefault=\"009015F9\" w:rsidP=\"008922AD\"><w:pPr><w:numPr><w:ilvl w:val=\"2\"/><w:numId w:val=\"2\"/></w:numPr><w:pBdr><w:top w:val=\"nil\"/><w:left w:val=\"nil\"/><w:bottom w:val=\"nil\"/><w:right w:val=\"nil\"/><w:between w:val=\"nil\"/></w:pBdr><w:spacing w:after=\"240\"/><w:jc w:val=\"both\"/><w:rPr><w:color w:val=\"000000\"/></w:rPr></w:pPr><w:r w:rsidRPr=\"00DA6010\"><w:rPr><w:b/><w:i/><w:color w:val=\"000000\"/></w:rPr><w:t>Disclosure</w:t></w:r><w:r w:rsidRPr=\"00DA6010\"><w:rPr><w:color w:val=\"000000\"/></w:rPr><w:t xml:space=\"preserve\">.  </w:t></w:r><w:del w:id=\"85\" w:author=\"Mixell, Daniel S.\" w:date=\"2026-04-06T15:53:00Z\" w16du:dateUtc=\"2026-04-06T20:53:00Z\"><w:r w:rsidRPr=\"00DA6010\" w:rsidDel=\"00CE3E41\"><w:rPr><w:color w:val=\"000000\"/></w:rPr><w:delText>Upon</w:delText></w:r><w:r w:rsidRPr=\"00DA6010\" w:rsidDel=\"00642419\"><w:rPr><w:color w:val=\"000000\"/></w:rPr><w:delText xml:space=\"preserve\"> delivery of any Deliverable and on completion of the Research Project, University shall provide to Colgate a written report detailing any Research Project IP developed in connection with the Research Project or embodied in the Deliverable.  University shall include in its written report a reasonable level of detail regarding the applicable Research Project IP and shall provide such </w:delText></w:r><w:r w:rsidRPr=\"00DA6010\" w:rsidDel=\"00642419\"><w:rPr><w:color w:val=\"000000\"/></w:rPr><w:lastRenderedPageBreak/><w:delText>additional information on the Research Project IP as is reasonably requested by Colgate</w:delText></w:r></w:del><w:ins w:id=\"86\" w:author=\"Mixell, Daniel S.\" w:date=\"2026-04-06T15:53:00Z\" w16du:dateUtc=\"2026-04-06T20:53:00Z\"><w:r w:rsidR=\"00642419\"><w:rPr><w:color w:val=\"000000\"/></w:rPr><w:t xml:space=\"preserve\"> </w:t></w:r></w:ins><w:ins w:id=\"87\" w:author=\"Mixell, Daniel S.\" w:date=\"2026-04-06T15:53:00Z\"><w:r w:rsidR=\"00642419\" w:rsidRPr=\"00642419\"><w:rPr><w:color w:val=\"000000\"/></w:rPr><w:t>Each Party will promptly notify the other Party of any Invention disclosure received by its technology management or equivalent office. The receiving Party shall treat all such Invention disclosures as Confidential Information. Notwithstanding Section 4.1, the receiving Party's obligation of confidentiality for Invention disclosures shall continue until the Confidential Information becomes publicly available through no action of the receiving Party. Each Party will promptly notify the other of any Joint Inventions.</w:t></w:r></w:ins><w:del w:id=\"88\" w:author=\"Mixell, Daniel S.\" w:date=\"2026-04-06T15:53:00Z\" w16du:dateUtc=\"2026-04-06T20:53:00Z\"><w:r w:rsidRPr=\"00642419\" w:rsidDel=\"00642419\"><w:rPr><w:color w:val=\"000000\"/></w:rPr><w:delText>.</w:delText></w:r></w:del></w:p><w:p w14:paraId=\"1F49C801\" w14:textId=\"0A719323\" w:rsidR=\"002266B5\" w:rsidRPr=\"00DA6010\" w:rsidDel=\"00642419\" w:rsidRDefault=\"009015F9\"><w:pPr><w:numPr><w:ilvl w:val=\"2\"/><w:numId w:val=\"2\"/></w:numPr><w:pBdr><w:top w:val=\"nil\"/><w:left w:val=\"nil\"/><w:bottom w:val=\"nil\"/><w:right w:val=\"nil\"/><w:between w:val=\"nil\"/></w:pBdr><w:spacing w:after=\"240\"/><w:jc w:val=\"both\"/><w:rPr><w:del w:id=\"89\" w:author=\"Mixell, Daniel S.\" w:date=\"2026-04-06T15:54:00Z\" w16du:dateUtc=\"2026-04-06T20:54:00Z\"/></w:rPr></w:pPr><w:bookmarkStart w:id=\"90\" w:name=\"_heading=h.1ksv4uv\" w:colFirst=\"0\" w:colLast=\"0\"/><w:bookmarkEnd w:id=\"90\"/><w:del w:id=\"91\" w:author=\"Mixell, Daniel S.\" w:date=\"2026-04-06T15:54:00Z\" w16du:dateUtc=\"2026-04-06T20:54:00Z\"><w:r w:rsidRPr=\"00DA6010\" w:rsidDel=\"00642419\"><w:rPr><w:b/><w:i/><w:color w:val=\"000000\"/></w:rPr><w:delText>Enforcement</w:delText></w:r><w:r w