roughout the term of this Agreement or (b) updated throughout the term of this Agreement at </w:t></w:r><w:hyperlink r:id=\"rId9\"><w:r w:rsidRPr=\"00DA6010\"><w:rPr><w:color w:val=\"0000FF\"/><w:sz w:val=\"21\"/><w:szCs w:val=\"21\"/><w:u w:val=\"single\"/></w:rPr><w:t>https://www.colgatepalmolive.com/en/us/corp/about/governance/third-party-code-of-conduct</w:t></w:r></w:hyperlink><w:r w:rsidRPr=\"00DA6010\"><w:rPr><w:color w:val=\"000000\"/></w:rPr><w:t>, including the requirement of strict compliance with the letter and spirit of applicable environmental laws and regulations and the public policies they represent.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId=\"2BCA0A1E\" w14:textId=\"4C34189B\" w:rsidR=\"002266B5\" w:rsidRPr=\"00DA6010\" w:rsidRDefault=\"009015F9\"><w:pPr><w:numPr><w:ilvl w:val=\"2\"/><w:numId w:val=\"2\"/></w:numPr><w:pBdr><w:top w:val=\"nil\"/><w:left w:val=\"nil\"/><w:bottom w:val=\"nil\"/><w:right w:val=\"nil\"/><w:between w:val=\"nil\"/></w:pBdr><w:spacing w:after=\"240\"/><w:jc w:val=\"both\"/><w:rPr><w:color w:val=\"000000\"/></w:rPr></w:pPr><w:r w:rsidRPr=\"00DA6010\"><w:rPr><w:b/><w:i/><w:color w:val=\"000000\"/></w:rPr><w:t>Global Anti-Bribery Policy</w:t></w:r><w:r w:rsidRPr=\"00DA6010\"><w:rPr><w:color w:val=\"000000\"/></w:rPr><w:t xml:space=\"preserve\">. </w:t></w:r><w:r w:rsidR=\"002A52A7\" w:rsidRPr=\"00DA6010\"><w:rPr><w:color w:val=\"000000\"/></w:rPr><w:t xml:space=\"preserve\"> </w:t></w:r><w:r w:rsidRPr=\"00DA6010\"><w:rPr><w:color w:val=\"000000\"/></w:rPr><w:t xml:space=\"preserve\">Attached to this Agreement as </w:t></w:r><w:r w:rsidRPr=\"00DA6010\"><w:rPr><w:color w:val=\"000000\"/><w:u w:val=\"single\"/></w:rPr><w:t>Exhibit C</w:t></w:r><w:r w:rsidRPr=\"00DA6010\"><w:rPr><w:color w:val=\"000000\"/></w:rPr><w:t xml:space=\"preserve\"> is a copy of Colgate’s Global Anti-Bribery Policy.  University represents and warrants that it has reviewed the contents of Colgate’s Global Anti-Bribery Policy and agrees that it shall abide by the t